id: CTB-SRC0012-A-3
source: SRC-0012
section: §A.3
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000082
text: Every discovered rule must be classified as one of: Seeded and configurable. Seeded but awaiting approval or activation. Intentionally fixed by a documented financial or security invariant. Unsupported or requiring implementation before it can be offered as a configuration option. Deprecated, with its replacement and migration path recorded.
